.Dd November 17, 2026
.Dt ENV 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm env
.Nd run a command with a modified environment
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl i
.Op Ar name Ns = Ns Ar value ...
.Op Ar command Op Ar argument ...
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
prints the current environment, or executes
.Ar command
with the modified environment.
Assignments are applied in command-line order.
If an assignment names an existing variable, it replaces that entry.
.Pp
The runtime exposes a bounded set of well-known variables
.Pq Ev PATH , HOME , USER , LOGNAME , SHELL , PWD , TERM ;
arbitrary exported variables are not enumerated yet.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl i
Start from an empty environment.
Only assignments and the command's own environment are visible.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A command that cannot be found exits 127; a command that cannot be executed
exits 126.
A usage error exits 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr getconf 1 ,
.Xr sh 1
.Sh STANDARDS
IEEE Std 1003.1-2024
.Pq POSIX.1-2024 .
